-## 6. AI attention / async control law
-
-**LONG-RUNNING WORK SHALL NOT REQUIRE LONG-RUNNING MODEL ATTENTION.**
-
-The AI should never need to sit in an open-ended tool wait just to learn whether work is progressing.
